</section>
</score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I love the Lord and that’s the fact!</l><l>He is my favorite Person.</l><l>He is the One who fills me to the brim.</l><l>I call His name and my heart beats pump pump pump…</l><l>I’m being filled, being filled with this living One,</l><l>O Lord Jesus, I love You!</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>
